      "date": "1920-02-24",
      "headline": "Founding of the Nazi Party",
      "text": "The German Workers' Party was renamed the National Socialist German Workers' Party (NSDAP), commonly known as the Nazi Party, during a public meeting at the Hofbräuhaus in Munich."
    },
