      "headline": "Start of the Battle of the Bulge",
      "text": "The Battle of the Bulge begins as German forces launch a surprise offensive through the Ardennes region of Belgium and Luxembourg, aiming to split the Allied lines and capture Antwerp."
    },
    {
      "date": "1944-12-17",
      "headline": "Malmedy Massacre",
      "text": "German SS troops execute 84 American prisoners of war near Malmedy, Belgium, in one of the most infamous atrocities of the battle."
    },
    {
