      "headline": "Stonehenge Protected by Law",
      "text": "Stonehenge was one of the first sites in the UK to be legally protected by the Ancient Monuments Protection Act of 1882."
    },
    {
      "date": "1918",
      "headline": "Ownership Transferred to the Nation",
      "text": "Cecil Chubb, the last private owner of Stonehenge, donated the site to the nation in 1918."
