      "text": "The Celtic languages were spoken in Gaul, which would later influence the development of the French language."
    },
    {
      "date": "0000",
      "headline": "Roman Conquest of Gaul",
      "text": "The Roman Empire conquered Gaul, leading to the spread of Vulgar Latin, which would become the basis for the Romance languages, including French."
