      "headline": "Negotiated Treaty of Ghent",
      "text": "Adams was a key negotiator in the Treaty of Ghent, which ended the War of 1812 between the United States and Great Britain."
    },
    {
      "date": "1817",
      "headline": "Secretary of State",
      "text": "John Quincy Adams was appointed as the U.S. Secretary of State by President James Monroe. He served in this role until 1825."
    },
    {
