      "date": "1970-04-15",
      "headline": "Perilune Passage",
      "text": "Apollo 13 passed around the far side of the Moon, reaching its closest approach, or perilune, at a distance of 254 km (158 miles) from the lunar surface."
    },
    {
      "date": "1970-04-17",
