      "headline": "Founding of Montreal",
      "text": "Montreal was founded as Ville-Marie by Paul Chomedey de Maisonneuve and Jeanne Mance, along with a group of French settlers. The settlement was established as a mission colony to convert Indigenous peoples to Christianity."
    },
