      "headline": "Construction Resumed",
      "text": "Construction of the cathedral resumed in 1842, under the direction of King Frederick William IV of Prussia. The completion of the cathedral became a symbol of German unity."
    },
    {
      "date": "1880-08-14",
      "headline": "Completion of Cologne Cathedral",
      "text": "Cologne Cathedral was finally completed on August 14, 1880, after more than 600 years of intermittent construction. The completion was celebrated as a national event in Germany."
    },
