      "headline": "Space Shuttle Columbia Disaster",
      "text": "On February 1, 2003, Space Shuttle Columbia disintegrated during re-entry into Earth's atmosphere over Texas and Louisiana. All seven astronauts on board were killed. This was the second Space Shuttle mission to end in disaster, following the Challenger disaster in 1986."
